{"title":"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Letters <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/9/2e9e84eb3b30456a70ab34b765c85e17bf227c6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A,B,C,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> represent four different digits selected from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/e/e8edc1092c202a8051777abd9766d89ea47ad826.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0,1,2,\\ldots ,9.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"96\" height=\"16\" /> If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/3/903e56b54285833930aa068c257dc4154e9fe41d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A+B)/(C+D)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"138\" height=\"18\" /> is an integer that is as large as possible, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/3/b831312585cb4ab6697896f86b72accbddbc4b45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/3/5139ddf2abd512cf44b83de0bb0cc6fbfd4bbe6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\  }13 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\  }14 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } 15\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  }16 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  } 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"388\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If we want <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/7/bc75b1258c218de138282cf7f26cf1d494a1ada4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{A+B}{C+D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"54\" height=\"39\" /> to be as large as possible, we want to try to maximize the numerator <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/3/b831312585cb4ab6697896f86b72accbddbc4b45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" /> and minimize the denominator <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/9/169e715676d726e920ca79d2e53b05192ddedc9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C+D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />.  Picking <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/6/826698ae674d37645f36277970439261b6e28d23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=9$\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/0/41052e2c3ff53b6410a48938e4cd92267bbe5d9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=8$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" /> will maximize the numerator, and picking <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/9/7296755ef63523ef0ed2e997caae100445bbb44d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C=0$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/2/fe2fac3dab3afa8b1d414ed5eadeba8ec1aaf08f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"13\" /> will minimize the denominator.  \n</p><p>Checking to make sure the fraction is an integer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/0/5602b37ab3676a386b9c13922ba9a6d88f7dd1b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{A+B}{C+D} = \\frac{17}{1} = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"144\" height=\"39\" />, and so the values are correct, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/9/169e9b20454a80cc862570b195b1c1ebe9529f62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+B = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"93\" height=\"14\" />, giving the answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/55206bce678ac0394d97dc04dd72398df2bdf572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME\" title=\"1998 AHSME\">1998 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selfl